{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bad Delivery: Pizza Your Heart is a short and cozy comedy otome RPG about working at a pizzeria!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045200/extras/2745871de3db7cf85dfc7f09a4b347d1.avif?t=1772812122\" width=164 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A recent college graduate down on her luck, Belle starts working at her local pizza place, PZA, because she desperately needs the money. But when one of her coworkers catches her eye, she sets a new goal: find love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide Belle through her first week at PZA as she tries to balance her work life with her love life. Will she master the way of the pizza arts? Will her dreams of romance be realized?  And most importantly\u2026 will she be able to pay her rent!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045200/extras/ddc59d706777595e18448143ab01db02.avif?t=1772812122\" width=148 height=68 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045200/extras/010b3c931aa5c07f28ef1f39a7a7c643.avif?t=1772812122\" width=560 height=623 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045200/extras/d0a653899f710a3e5a380a3d127cbf2d.avif?t=1772812122\" width=560 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045200/extras/51898f718a7e432d0df472abd78b67fb.avif?t=1772812122\" width=560 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><spa